

rem *** e_FlakBig ***
ObjectTemplate.create EffectBundle e_FlakBig
ObjectTemplate.saveInSeparateFile 1
ObjectTemplate.loadSoundScript Sounds/flakbig.ssc
rem -------------------------------------
ObjectTemplate.addTemplate Em_flak_Big
ObjectTemplate.timeToLive CRD_NONE/0.1/0/0
rem -------------------------------------


rem *** Em_flak_Big ***
ObjectTemplate.create Emitter Em_flak_Big
ObjectTemplate.template Fx_flak_Big
ObjectTemplate.lodDistance 700
ObjectTemplate.timeToLive CRD_NONE/0.1/0/0
ObjectTemplate.intensity CRD_UNIFORM/2/0/0
ObjectTemplate.relativePositionInDof CRD_NORMAL/0/0.1/1
ObjectTemplate.relativePositionInUp CRD_NORMAL/0/0.1/1
ObjectTemplate.relativePositionInRight CRD_NORMAL/0/0.1/1
ObjectTemplate.startRotation CRD_UNIFORM/1/90/0


rem *** Fx_flak_Big ***
ObjectTemplate.create SpriteParticle Fx_flak_Big
ObjectTemplate.timeToLive CRD_UNIFORM/1/0.2/0
ObjectTemplate.size CRD_UNIFORM/15/16/0
ObjectTemplate.gravityModifier CRD_NONE/-0.2/0/0
ObjectTemplate.sizeOverTime 0/0|1/1|9/0.959975|100/0.599994
ObjectTemplate.gravityModifierOverTime 0/0|100/1
ObjectTemplate.texture e_flak2
ObjectTemplate.initRotation CRD_NORMAL/0/180/1
ObjectTemplate.destBlendMode BMInvSourceAlpha
ObjectTemplate.rotationSpeed CRD_NORMAL/20/50/1
ObjectTemplate.rotationSpeedOverTime 0/0|100/1
ObjectTemplate.colorRGBAOverTime 0/0/0/0/255|26/0/0/0/255|100/0/0/0/0
